`{tip} The projects in this module are designed to be building blocks for your own research. Combine elements from multiple projects: use the ERA5 pipeline (Project 5) to download data, compute extremes (Project 4), and generate an automated report (Project 8). The skills you have learned throughout this course will serve you well in climate data analysis.`

